      "case_id": "contrast_001",
      "problem_id": "square_derivative",
      "reference": {
        "primary_technique": "Derivative Definition",
        "rationale": "以導數的差商極限定義作為主要目標，將 (y² − x²)/(y − x) 化為 y + x，再證明 y 趨近 x 時極限為 2x。代數化簡與連續性用於求差商極限，未套用冪次微分法則。",
        "case_types": [
          "same_method_variant",
          "different_primary_methods"
        ],
        "status": "predefined"
      },
      "request": {
        "model": "typesafe/jev-1.13",
        "state": {
          "problem_text": "求函數 f(x) = x² 在任意實數 x 的導數，並證明導數為 2x。",
          "lean_imports": [
            "import Mathlib"
          ],
          "lean_statement": "(x : ℝ) : HasDerivAt (fun y : ℝ => y ^ 2) (2 * x) x",
          "proof_body": "by\n  apply hasDerivAt_iff_tendsto_slope.mpr\n  have hc : ContinuousAt (fun y : ℝ => y + x) x :=\n    continuousAt_id.add continuousAt_const\n  have hlim : Filter.Tendsto (fun y : ℝ => y + x)\n      (nhdsWithin x {x}ᶜ) (nhds (2 * x)) := by\n    simpa only [two_mul] using hc.tendsto.mono_left\n      (nhdsWithin_le_nhds : nhdsWithin x {x}ᶜ ≤ nhds x)\n  apply hlim.congr'\n  filter_upwards [self_mem_nhdsWithin] with y hy\n  have hyne : y - x ≠ 0 := sub_ne_zero.mpr (by simpa using hy)\n  simp only [slope_def_field]\n  field_simp [hyne]\n  ring"
        },
        "questions": {
          "primary_method": {
            "type": "choice",
            "instructions": "判斷這份 Lean 證明實際使用的課本主要方法，從固定選項中選出一個。主要方法是組織整份解答、完成主要目標的數學策略；只用於局部計算、化簡或中間步驟的方法，屬於輔助方法。同一主要方法中的不同數學推導、參數選擇、證明順序或 tactic 寫法，不另算一種方法。請根據實際證明結構判斷，不要只依題目要求、命題形式、個別關鍵字或某個定理是否出現來分類。",
